cff-version: 1.2.0
message: Please cite the research report in preferred-citation when discussing Diffyn, and
  record the software version used.
type: software
title: Diffyn
authors:
- name: nathcymru
  website: https://github.com/nathcymru
version: 0.1.0
abstract: A local Rust Model Context Protocol server providing preference-led text formatting,
  explicit-step extraction, clarity review, reusable prompts, and bundled guidance for neurodivergent
  communication.
repository-code: https://github.com/nathcymru/Diffyn
url: https://github.com/nathcymru/Diffyn
license: MIT
keywords:
- neurodiversity
- cognitive accessibility
- communication preferences
- Model Context Protocol
- Rust
